<title>USA: Uroquest reschedules IPO - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Uroquest reschedules IPO - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uroquest's planned initial public offering, which had previously been postponed, is now tentatively scheduled for mid-October, according to lead underwriter Dillon Read &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Uroquest develops products for the management and diagnosis of urological disorder. It plans to offer 3.35 million shares in an estimated price range of $11 to $13 under the proposed symbol &quot;UROQ&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
</text>
